  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 的模組。用心打造。大量活躍的 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《磨石器鋒化》是一款極簡風格的模組，為磨石器新增了暫時提升在其上使用之工具傷害的功能。</span> <br><br></p>\n<p>在磨石器上<strong>蹲下+右鍵點擊</strong>任何工具即可進行鋒化。這將為工具賦予 <strong>N</strong>&nbsp;次鋒化使用次數（於設定檔中定義）。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>usesAfterGrinding</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 32，最小 1，最大 5000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;在磨石器上使用後，工具擁有的鋒化使用次數。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sharpenedDamageModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 1.5，最小 0，最大 100.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;鋒化工具的傷害修正係數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>sendUsesLeftInChat</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;當鋒化使用次數剩餘 75%、50%、25%、10% 時，向使用者發送訊息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>showUsesLeftInItemName</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;於物品名稱中顯示剩餘使用次數。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameUsesPrefix</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 \"(Sharpened uses: \"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;工具名稱中顯示剩餘鋒化次數的前綴。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>nameUsesSuffix</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;預設 =&nbsp; \")\"</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&nbsp;工具名稱中顯示剩餘鋒化次數的字尾。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><strong>手持工具蹲下+右鍵點擊磨石器：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/a.jpg\" alt=\"0\" width=\"1423\" height=\"827\"></strong><br><br><strong>這將對工具進行鋒化，並可選地將其顯示於物品名稱中。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"684\" height=\"281\"></strong><br><br><strong>攻擊任何實體時，傷害將依照設定檔中的修正係數增加：<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"664\"></strong><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>您也可在聊天視窗中接收剩餘使用次數的提示：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/grindstone-sharper-tools/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"720\" height=\"137\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可在任何整合包中自由使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於模組頁面眾多，我無法追蹤各處的留言，因此已關閉評論功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a> 提交。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
